---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="FAQ">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-2 py-6 pb-8">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2 pt-6">FAQ</h1>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold pt-6">Where can I buy your products?</h2>
        <p class="pt-2 text-lg text-gray-800 leading-8">We sell through <a href="https://www.crowdsupply.com/icy-electronics" class="underline hover:no-underline">Crowd Supply</a>, <a href="https://www.elecrow.com" class="underline hover:no-underline">Elecrow</a> and <a href="https://lectronz.com" class="underline hover:no-underline">Lectronz</a>. Every product on the <a href="/store/all-products" class="underline hover:no-underline">products page</a> links to the stores that carry it.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold pt-6">Do you ship to my country?</h2>
        <p class="pt-2 text-lg text-gray-800 leading-8">Shipping options and costs depend on the store you order from, so check there at checkout.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold pt-6">When can I get a Comu?</h2>
        <p class="pt-2 text-lg text-gray-800 leading-8">Comu is in pre-launch on <a href="https://www.crowdsupply.com/icy-electronics/comu" class="underline hover:no-underline">Crowd Supply</a>. Sign up there to get an email when it launches.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold pt-6">I need help with my board.</h2>
        <p class="pt-2 text-lg text-gray-800 leading-8">Email <a href="mailto:support@icy.computer" class="underline hover:no-underline">support@icy.computer</a> or ask on our <a href="https://discord.gg/vzrqfhcvWr" class="underline hover:no-underline">Discord</a>.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold pt-6">Do you do bulk orders or custom designs?</h2>
        <p class="pt-2 text-lg text-gray-800 leading-8">Yes, <a href="/contact" class="underline hover:no-underline">get in touch</a> and tell us what you need.</p>
    </div>
</Layout>
